1
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,700
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:43,560
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:46,680
=Episode 7=

4
00:00:57,359 --> 00:00:58,280
Have a drink.

5
00:01:07,959 --> 00:01:10,040
It's been so long since we sat down
like this in peace.

6
00:01:10,879 --> 00:01:12,640
I really miss our college days.

7
00:01:12,799 --> 00:01:14,599
Back then, we didn't have a care
in the world.

8
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:15,719
By the way,

9
00:01:16,359 --> 00:01:17,920
I've never heard you mention

10
00:01:17,959 --> 00:01:19,680
what you like to do in your spare time.

11
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:21,560
Me?

12
00:01:24,319 --> 00:01:25,920
I guess I like painting.

13
00:01:27,519 --> 00:01:28,879
If you like something, you like it.

14
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:30,359
There's no need to say "I guess".

15
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:33,359
Take me, for example. I love dancing.

16
00:01:34,159 --> 00:01:35,480
I've loved it since I was little.

17
00:01:36,959 --> 00:01:37,959
For all these years,

18
00:01:37,959 --> 00:01:39,439
I've never had the courage to ask you...

19
00:01:40,159 --> 00:01:42,079
Why did you suddenly leave back then?

20
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:44,079
You left before finishing college.

21
00:01:44,439 --> 00:01:45,879
Not even a word of goodbye.

22
00:01:45,879 --> 00:01:47,439
You just left the country.

23
00:01:48,599 --> 00:01:49,799
Back then,

24
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:53,359
I didn't get the chance to say goodbye
to you all.

25
00:01:55,719 --> 00:01:57,040
Not long after you left,

26
00:01:57,439 --> 00:01:59,000
Zhang Haotian came into my life.

27
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:02,359
My mom was seriously ill at the time.

28
00:02:02,959 --> 00:02:04,480
I was completely broken.

29
00:02:06,079 --> 00:02:07,519
He stayed by my side every day.

30
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:10,439
He treated me so well.

31
00:02:12,039 --> 00:02:13,840
I thought he truly loved me.

32
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:16,560
But later, I found out...

33
00:02:19,599 --> 00:02:20,439
My kidney

34
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:22,840
was the price he paid to climb
into a wealthy family.

35
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:27,319
That's why I hate him so much.

36
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:30,840
All the pain I suffered,

37
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:33,639
I'll make him pay it back
a thousand times over.

38
00:02:46,479 --> 00:02:48,280
I want to go get some skewers
at the pedestrian street.

39
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:49,120
Let's go together?

40
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:50,360
Sure.

41
00:02:52,319 --> 00:02:52,960
(Jiang Lai.)

42
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,400
(I'm leaving the country.)

43
00:02:56,439 --> 00:02:57,759
(I need to get away from here.)

44
00:02:59,319 --> 00:03:00,919
(I'll never come back.)

45
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:04,120
(Take care of yourself.)

46
00:03:04,919 --> 00:03:06,240
(We both need)

47
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:08,400
(to protect ourselves.)

48
00:03:13,759 --> 00:03:15,080
(I never thought)

49
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:17,199
(the man I desperately tried
to escape from)

50
00:03:17,719 --> 00:03:19,039
(would turn his claws)

51
00:03:19,199 --> 00:03:21,159
(toward my best friend.)

52
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:23,599
(This time,)

53
00:03:23,719 --> 00:03:24,840
(I won't run away.)

54
00:03:25,199 --> 00:03:26,520
(I'll stand by her side.)

55
00:03:26,879 --> 00:03:28,199
(Everything you owe us,)

56
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:30,000
(every single debt,)

57
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,439
(we'll make you pay.)

58
00:03:31,639 --> 00:03:33,280
Zhang Haotian...

59
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:36,319
Why me?

60
00:03:38,039 --> 00:03:40,560
Why did you deceive me?

61
00:03:42,439 --> 00:03:43,520
Why?

62
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,840
You exposed your own affair

63
00:03:49,719 --> 00:03:51,759
and handed the evidence
to Lin Lulu yourself?

64
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:53,360
Zhang Haotian,

65
00:03:53,719 --> 00:03:54,879
so this is how you're pushing Lin Lulu

66
00:03:54,879 --> 00:03:56,360
to steal the prenuptial agreement
faster?

67
00:03:56,759 --> 00:03:57,919
Are you crazy?

68
00:03:57,920 --> 00:03:58,280
(Air Conditioner;
Drainage Water)

69
00:03:58,280 --> 00:03:58,840
Chen Ping,

70
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:00,879
Trust my judgment.

71
00:04:00,879 --> 00:04:02,240
Your judgment? Nonsense!

72
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,960
Who was the woman helping you
fake the affair?

73
00:04:08,199 --> 00:04:08,960
Zhao Ke.

74
00:04:11,599 --> 00:04:13,719
After sending the photos to Su Qinglan,

75
00:04:14,319 --> 00:04:16,000
there was no reaction from her.

76
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:17,959
How is that possible?

77
00:04:18,279 --> 00:04:20,439
Isn't Lin Lulu her daughter?

78
00:04:21,759 --> 00:04:24,439
Su Qinglan would definitely show
those photos to Lin Lulu.

79
00:04:25,839 --> 00:04:28,839
What kind of woman do you think
Lin Lulu is?

80
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:32,040
(Lin Lulu's Personal Profile)

81
00:04:35,279 --> 00:04:36,079
Haotian.

82
00:04:36,520 --> 00:04:37,800
(Air Conditioner;
Drainage Water)

83
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:38,639
Listen to me.

84
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:41,560
We're in this together.

85
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:42,560
If this blows up,

86
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,360
we're both finished.

87
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:46,399
We both know how much power
Su Qinglan holds in Jingzhou.

88
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,040
The only reason she hasn't come
after you

89
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,560
is because Lin Lulu
has been protecting you.

90
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:51,079
If Lin Lulu stops covering for you,

91
00:04:51,439 --> 00:04:52,279
Su Qinglan could crush you

92
00:04:52,279 --> 00:04:53,959
like an ant.

93
00:04:53,959 --> 00:04:54,480
Then just pretend

94
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:55,680
I never brought it up.

95
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:56,639
Zhang Haotian!

96
00:04:58,079 --> 00:05:00,000
She's rich and spoiled.

97
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:02,920
And apparently, she's used
all her brain on love.

98
00:05:03,399 --> 00:05:05,079
So...

99
00:05:05,879 --> 00:05:07,160
So,

100
00:05:07,199 --> 00:05:09,600
either Lin Lulu thinks the video
is fake,

101
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:10,800
or

102
00:05:11,279 --> 00:05:12,519
Zhang Haotian will make her

103
00:05:12,519 --> 00:05:13,680
believe it's fake.

104
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,000
Are you sure about this?

105
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:33,800
Have you ever seen me do something

106
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:34,680
I wasn't sure about?

107
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,839
No wonder

108
00:05:36,839 --> 00:05:38,720
you sent the video to me

109
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,000
instead of her back then.

110
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,680
Not entirely.

111
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:46,480
So what do we do now?

112
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,199
When are you planning to meet her?

113
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:51,720
(Air Conditioner;
Drainage Water)

114
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,519
Right away.

115
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,720
(Zhang Haotian)

116
00:06:09,079 --> 00:06:10,000
Mr. Zhang,

117
00:06:13,279 --> 00:06:15,040
I've transferred half a million yuan
to you.

118
00:06:15,639 --> 00:06:16,759
And I've sent you the location as well.

119
00:06:20,279 --> 00:06:21,279
Are you going?

120
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:24,800
Yes.

121
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:28,399
The only way to get leverage
on Zhang Haotian is to go.

122
00:06:29,439 --> 00:06:30,319
Besides,

123
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:32,160
I'm still playing the role
of a nightclub girl.

124
00:06:32,639 --> 00:06:33,720
If he wants to sleep with me,

125
00:06:34,279 --> 00:06:35,920
I don't really have a reason to refuse,
do I?

126
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:50,399
So, where are we talking today?

127
00:06:52,439 --> 00:06:53,279
No talking today.

128
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:54,439
We're just shopping.

129
00:06:54,759 --> 00:06:55,600
Shopping?

130
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:58,839
You paid half a million

131
00:06:58,839 --> 00:07:00,680
just to have me walk around with you?

132
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:04,639
If you could also
have a cup of tea with me,

133
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,360
I'd say the money

134
00:07:07,079 --> 00:07:08,000
was even better spent.

135
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,959
You were the one who accused me
of seducing you.

136
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:13,920
You got Ms. Lin to fire me

137
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:15,040
and cost me my job.

138
00:07:15,279 --> 00:07:18,279
Then you followed me to the bar
and even the set.

139
00:07:19,279 --> 00:07:21,279
Your attitude changed way too fast.

140
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:22,439
I don't understand.

141
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,399
Knowing how cunning you are,

142
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,480
you wouldn't have set some kind of trap

143
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:29,839
and waited for me to jump, would you?

144
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:35,040
You jumped from a building that high

145
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:37,360
and weren't even afraid of death.

146
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,759
Why would you be afraid
of my little trap?

147
00:07:39,879 --> 00:07:40,800
Who knows,

148
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:43,120
maybe I'm the one who fell into yours.

149
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,319
Shopping, huh?

150
00:07:46,319 --> 00:07:48,040
Fine. Let's shop.

151
00:08:04,399 --> 00:08:06,839
Are you sure you want me
to pick out your clothes?

152
00:08:07,399 --> 00:08:08,120
Yes.

153
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:11,519
The clothes I pick for you,

154
00:08:11,519 --> 00:08:12,839
will you dare wear them

155
00:08:12,839 --> 00:08:14,199
in front of Ms. Lin?

156
00:08:14,199 --> 00:08:15,279
Of course.

157
00:08:15,439 --> 00:08:16,519
I don't believe you.

158
00:08:17,519 --> 00:08:18,920
How would you know without trying?

159
00:08:24,279 --> 00:08:25,920
Fine. Let's try.

160
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:28,120
I wasn't finished.

161
00:08:30,399 --> 00:08:31,439
You help me try them on.

162
00:08:44,040 --> 00:08:46,080
(A Trap within a Trap)

163
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:50,880
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

164
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:53,760
♪I should forget you♪

165
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:59,000
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

166
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:00,960
♪To carry on♪

167
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:06,200
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

168
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:09,880
♪You no longer have the strength♪

169
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:14,680
♪You want me to go there for you♪

170
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:20,840
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

171
00:09:21,160 --> 00:09:25,000
♪Your freedom♪

172
00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:30,480
♪Has become my cage♪

173
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:37,280
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

174
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:43,400
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

175
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:50,800
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

176
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:53,680
♪You told me♪

177
00:09:53,680 --> 00:09:58,840
♪I would shine like a star♪

178
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:03,880
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

179
00:10:03,880 --> 00:10:07,520
♪How to live without you♪

180
00:10:07,760 --> 00:10:11,920
♪I look up♪

181
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:14,680
♪The starry sky♪

182
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:18,480
♪So hazy and blurred♪
